{"id":"n24581-1-10","stage":4,"title":"조그마하다 · 小巧","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24581-1-10-1","ko":"방울토마토 좀 드시겠어요?","zh":"要来点樱桃番茄吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"방울토마토","meaning":"小西红柿","explanation":"방울토마토：小西红柿。","readings":[{"term":"방울토마토","audio":"/audio/597f5ba7bb9843b92ecf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58115","senseId":"1","lemma":"방울토마토","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"방울토마토","audio":"/audio/597f5ba7bb9843b92ecf.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"드시겠어요?","meaning":"用餐、吃或喝（敬语）","explanation":"들다：用餐、吃或喝（敬语）；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57293","senseId":"3","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드시겠어요","audio":"/audio/bd87666483297d02079d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"597f5ba7bb9843b9","term":"방울토마토","zh":"小西红柿","audio":"/audio/597f5ba7bb9843b92ecf.mp3","entryId":"58115","definition":"一口大小的小番茄。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"用餐、吃或喝（敬语）","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"57293","definition":"(尊称)吃。","pronunciation":["들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/60d5376187431e49a5e6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24581-1-10-2","ko":"고맙습니다. 조그마한 게 정말 맛있네요.","zh":"谢谢。这些小小的真的很好吃呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"고맙습니다.","meaning":"感谢，感激","explanation":"고맙다：感谢，感激；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"고맙다","audio":"/audio/ded2b4943e89f57dd33d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20041","senseId":"1","lemma":"고맙다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고맙습니다","audio":"/audio/df3145eb9e053a1eb614.mp3"}},{"text":"조그마한","meaning":"小巧，不丁点儿","explanation":"조그마하다：小巧，不丁点儿；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"조그마하다","audio":"/audio/bc852830c5a09b20585b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24581","senseId":"1","lemma":"조그마하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조그마한","audio":"/audio/518132ae25f33e6789bb.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"东西，事，的","explanation":"것：东西，事，的；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"1","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"맛있네요.","meaning":"好吃，可口，香","explanation":"맛있다：好吃，可口，香；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"맛있다","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70811","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맛있네요","audio":"/audio/d90adf9c116964af26d5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ded2b4943e89f57d","term":"고맙다","zh":"感谢，感激","audio":"/audio/ded2b4943e89f57dd33d.mp3","entryId":"20041","definition":"因别人为自己做了什么，内心感到很满足，并想给予回报。","pronunciation":["고ː맙따"]},{"id":"bc852830c5a09b20","term":"조그마하다","zh":"小巧，不丁点儿","audio":"/audio/bc852830c5a09b20585b.mp3","entryId":"24581","definition":"稍小或少。","pronunciation":["조그마하다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"东西，事，的","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"泛指各种事物或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"i